  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: afe46c950e4801d44beb311b827ea6c0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_ZEVLab_ending
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Style: 0
  Nodes:
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f339d0df707e4bdd9c7c5a0e8f9f2ca2, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.ending.00
    DefaultText: "여기까지 하죠. 실습은 충분합니다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e43b565b4b937d42bd80c85eb983cae, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.ending.01
    DefaultText: "이 정도면 못 찾은 척 넘어가 주셔도 되지 않나요?"
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f339d0df707e4bdd9c7c5a0e8f9f2ca2, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.ending.02
    DefaultText: "…이번 의뢰는 교육 목적이었다고 보고하겠습니다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e43b565b4b937d42bd80c85eb983cae, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.ending.03
    DefaultText: "그 말, 지금 대화 기록에 남겼습니다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
